[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_01_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_01_0010","text":"……！\n制作人……！这是……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_01_0020","text":"嗯。\n是ALSTROEMERIA的团体演出服。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_01_0022","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_01_0023","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_01_0030","text":"好漂亮……\n真的像花一样……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_01_0040","text":"是啊。\n不过，还没有完全绽放。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_01_0050","text":"诶……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_01_0060","text":"真正开得绚烂的时候，是甘奈穿上它\n站上舞台的那一刻。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_01_0070","text":"我是这么想的……\n——哎呀，是不是有点太耍帅了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_01_0080","text":"才没有那回事！\n甘奈也，想那样……觉得……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_01_0090","text":"制作人。\n甘奈一定会让最棒的花朵盛开的。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_01_0100","text":"一定会的。\n要好好看着我哦！"}]
